PRIVACY POLICY

I collect nothing.

No email. No location. No contacts. No usage tracking. No ad IDs. No analytics. Nothing to sell, and nothing to "anonymize" and sell anyway.

What happens on your device stays on your device.

No account needed. No account exists.
I don't have a database of you, because I didn't build one.

No third parties, no data brokers, no mysterious "trusted partners."

No ads. None. Zero. I built this app for ease of use, not to interrupt your mornings with something you didn't ask for.

The games linked within this app are not mine, and I have no control over them. Some of them have ads. I know. I hate it too. That's on their end, not mine — I can't strip ads out of someone else's game, as much as I'd like to.

For the record: I think collecting and using people's data without their real, informed consent is a scam labeled as an "industry standard." I'm not interested in participating in it, quietly or otherwise.

